  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Indicator",
    "type_designations": ["C510", "C520", "C530"],
    "description": "Digital indicating device for use as part of a single/dual range/interval, Class III non-automatic weighing instrument. Self-indicating, DC or mains-powered. C510 features: ABS plastic enclosure, six digit LED display, five function keys, weighing status, multiple range/interval status, connections and ports located at the rear. Devices: extended indicating device, printing device, totalising device, initial zero setting device, zero tracking device, semi-automatic zero setting device, tare setting device (semi-automatic, balancing, subtractive or additive), preset tare device, multi-range device, multi-interval device, lb/kg switching device, gross/net switching device, calibration device, piece counting device, fault handling device, display test device on power up, alibi memory device, zero indicator, indication of stable equilibrium."
  },
